OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre, which already has
OL,4,A#20m repair bill, needs roof
OL,5,Areplacement
OL,6,
OL,7,FA #17m leisure centre which suffered so
OL,8,Fmany construction failings that it cost
OL,9,Fmore to repair than it did to
OL,10,Foriginally build is to have part of its
OL,11,Froof replaced.
OL,13,FThe DG1 facility in Dumfries opened in
OL,14,F2008 but was forced to close completely
OL,15,Fin 2014 for an overhaul which took
OL,16,Fnearly five years and cost #20m to
OL,17,Fcomplete.
OL,19,FIn 2018, the head of an inquiry said he
OL,20,Fhad never seen so many issues at one
OL,21,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
