OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre, which already has
OL,4,A#20m repair bill, needs roof
OL,5,Areplacement
OL,6,
OL,7,FDumfries and Galloway Council has now
OL,8,Fsaid problems have been identified with
OL,9,Fits rotunda roof which would need to be
OL,10,Freplaced - probably next year -
OL,11,Frequiring the closure of its leisure
OL,12,Fpool with pirate ship and children's
OL,13,Fslides.
